  "Pre-war trends for services (OECD-WTO BaTiS, Eurostat, Bank of Russia), foreign companies in Russia and Russian seaborne exports": "Tendances d'avant-guerre pour les services (OECD-WTO BaTiS, Eurostat, Bank of Russia), les entreprises étrangères en Russie et les exportations maritimes russes",
